    "CurrentNN ROI cannot independently reacquire when the existing hand model supplies no ROI.",
    "Second recording was already used for prior tuning; manual whole-hand and fingertip ROIs are oracle only.",
    "Other-digit crops are cached-model proposals, not independent digit groundtruth.",
    "Blank controls have known absence of a hand and fail at the frozen author confidence threshold.",
    "Native RGB is nearest reencoded PNG; exact gray case uses immutable cached planes with hash verification.",
